UnitLeafEmissionsHandler::constructor
├── when leafVoter is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when receiptToken is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when all inputs are valid
    ├── it should set LEAF_VOTER to _leafVoter
    └── it should set RECEIPT_TOKEN to _receiptToken

UnitLeafEmissionsHandler::handleEmissions
├── when the caller is not the leaf voter
│   └── it should revert with CallerNotLeafVoter
└── given the caller is the leaf voter
    ├── when every amount is zero
    │   └── it should not call transfer on the receipt token
    └── when some amounts are nonzero
        ├── it should call safeTransfer on the receipt token for each nonzero amount
        └── it should skip recipients with a zero amount
